## Do's and Don'ts

Do:

- Run Taste Generator before making permanent design claims.

Don't:

- Do not treat scaffold defaults as owner-approved taste.

## Responsive Behavior

- Preserve hierarchy and readable line length.
- Collapse dense grids into mobile-safe flows.
- Avoid text overlap and card nesting.

